# keep the build context small: operator media, extracted ROM, disk images,
# vendored source (fetched fresh inside the Dockerfile), and scratch state
# never need to be sent to the Docker daemon as build context.
*.iso
*.img
*.rom
*.dsk
*.hda
*.raw
*.log
*.ppm
*.png
src/
qemu_work/
__pycache__/
.git/
